The text and data of the Kyoto example in this directory (all JSON files and this folder's
README) are dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal:
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
Facts in them come from the official sources cited next to each entry; check those sources
before relying on any fact.

The photos under media/ are NOT covered by CC0. They come from Wikimedia Commons and keep
their own licenses (CC0, public domain or CC BY 2.0/2.5/3.0/4.0). The creator, license and
source page of every photo are listed in photo-sources.json (place photos) and in the body of
each post in posts.json (post photos). Keep that attribution when you reuse them.

When you replace this example with your own content, that content keeps its own licenses.

本目录中京都示例的文字与数据（全部 JSON 与本目录的 README）以 CC0 1.0 放弃版权；其中的事实来自各条目旁
引用的官方来源，使用前请以来源为准。media/ 下的照片不适用 CC0：它们来自 Wikimedia Commons，各自保留原
许可证（CC0、公有领域或 CC BY 2.0/2.5/3.0/4.0），作者、许可与来源见 photo-sources.json（地点照片）和
posts.json 各篇正文末尾（攻略配图）。转用时请保留署名。
